I . X'i a ce a la ing C,o ittee.- (l) The Finance and Planning Committeeshall consist ofl(a) Rector (Convener);(b) allDeans;(c) Treasurer;(d) one member of the Board to be nominated by the Board;(e) one memberlof the Academic Council to be nominated by theAcademic Council;(D Director General Finance of the Commission or his nominee;(g) one representative each from the Higher Education and FinanceDepartments of the Government not below the rank of a DeputySecretary;(h) Registrar; and(i) One nominee ofthe Company.(2) The term of office of the nominated members shall be threeyears.(3) Five members of the Finance and planning Committeeshall constitute the quorum for a meeting ofthe Finance and Planning Cornmittee.11. ctio s of t e Fina ce an lanning Co ittee.-The Finance and planningCornmittee shall:(a) prepare the anntral statement of accounts and propose annual budget estimatesand advise the Board thereon;(b) review periodically the financial position of the Institute;(c) advise the Board on all maffers relating to finance, investments and accountsof the Institute; and(d) perform such other functions as may be prescribed by the Statutes.
